## Active concerns

- AT_RISK_MAX_CANDIDATES = 5000 is a soft cap. Trigger for revisit:
  single deck reaches >5K cards.
- Full calibration curve (predicted-bucket × actual pass rate) deferred
  until enough `review_events` accumulate (~1000+ events needed).
- `response_ms` measurement in MultipleChoiceQuiz still unimplemented
  (all events emit null).
- Apple Developer Program enrollment pending — TestFlight + push
  notifications blocked until then.

